OL,3,ASpeeding driver jailed for fatal
OL,4,ALamborghini crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who caused the death of her
OL,7,Ffriend when she lost control of a
OL,8,Frented Lamborghini and crashed into a
OL,9,Fmotorway barrier has been jailed for 10
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FMohammed Shaan Hussain, 20, died when
OL,13,FHumaira Batool crashed the #200,000
OL,14,Fsupercar on the M62, near Ripponden, in
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire, in December 2022,
OL,16,Fcausing it to flip over and burst into
OL,17,Fflames.
OL,19,FDuring her trial, jurors heard Batool,
OL,20,F26, from Bradford, had been driving at
OL,21,Fspeeds of up to 140mph (230km/h) in wet
OL,22,Fconditions shortly before the crash.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
