OL,3,ASpeeding driver jailed for fatal
OL,4,ALamborghini crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassing sentence, Judge Ray Singh said
OL,7,FHussain died as a result of Batool's
OL,8,Fdecision to drive the "powerful
OL,9,Fperformance vehicle" at "eye-watering
OL,10,Fextreme speeds on a damp motorway in
OL,11,Fdarkness".
